      "created_at": "2014-02-06T05:45:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It occurred to me today that Vengeance is probably Sentinel Comics's answer to Marvel's Secret Wars - presumably most if not all of the villains are presumed to have premiered in other comics, and Vengeance was them all coming back as part of Blade's master plan.&nbsp; Anyone else have similar thoughts?&nbsp; I'm trying to imagine a story epic enough to require this many freaking characters in it, and it's quite a tall order....</p>",
